{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome aboard the Sea of Dreams, can you survive to this nightmare\u00a0?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fend against vast enemy forces, with hundreds of nightmarish foes swarming the screen at any given time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this action-packed rogue-lite, you play as one of the survivors trapped aboard the Sea of Dreams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Slay, adapt, and grow stronger with every wave of enemies\u2014then slay even more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your abilities, and unlock unique perks to adapt to the escalating chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Set in the terrifying universe of Sea of Dreams, this standalone spin-off delivers relentless action in a world steeped in dread and mystery. Will you endure the horrors of The Other World and find your way back, or will you become another lost soul aboard the Sea of Dreams?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The nightmare begins. Will you survive?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3484590?t=1744809847","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484590/8e56c4d69187c9551c84c8ecf06967822958b43e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744809847","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484590/cb5192d53607951bda1a56288ed907043d7c3e78/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744809847","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484590/cb5192d53607951bda1a56288ed907043d7c3e78/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744809847","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3650120,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome aboard